   634	
   635	### 6.1 What grows, in closed form
   636	
   637	The finiteness of DO's census is `sum_{v~ ∈ v'} Deg v~ = N` (DF-2). At general
   638	`N` the fork list is `{(m,n) : m >= 2, mn <= N}` and, by `(4.3)`, a fork of
   639	longitudinal degree `m` at a valence-3 target vertex admits one triple of
   640	partitions of `m`, one per direction, with `m + 2` parts in total. Hence
   641	
   642	```text
   643	  Rows(m) = [z^{m+2}] f_m(z)^3 ,   f_m(z) = sum_{r>=1} P(m,r) z^r ,
   644	  Census(N) = sum_{m>=2} floor(N/m) · Rows(m) .
   645	```
   646	
   647	MEASURED (driver `/tmp/b3bi/census.py`, exact integer arithmetic):
   648	
   649	```text
