   659	its `(4,1)` sub-count `3 + 12 + 8 = 23` is `Rows(4) = 23`). That is the positive
   660	control on the growth analysis. The growth is roughly geometric with ratio
   661	`~2.3-2.9` at these degrees and is driven by `Rows(m) <= p(m)^3`; it is not
   662	polynomial. **The affine ledger does not touch it.**
