   664	### 6.2 What the affine data *does* bound: the assembly depth
   665	
   666	> **PROPOSITION BI-8 (spine-depth cap; all `N`).** Along the spine of maximal
   667	> constant blocks and forks running outward from a dicritical `l`, the values of
   668	> `Deg` are strictly increasing (a fork merges `>= 2` incoming packets) and are
