   628	
   629	* **Flag/place/series.** Four groups kept apart throughout: `Loc_{p_0}`,
   630	  `Loc_{q_i}`, `G = pi_1(C^2\A_F)`, `G_{p,q}`. The identification HT makes in
   631	  case (A) (`G ≅ G_{p,q}`) is **not** made here; §2.1 records that it is false
   632	  in (B3) and §2.3 refutes the global CENTRAL-RANK rather than transporting it.
