+Calling `35`, `85`, or `126` a realised survivor count would violate the
+carrier/attainment rule. Calling `83`, `278`, or `284` the requested result
+would omit incidence. Calling the answer `25`, `44`, or `75` after a
+repeated-unit screen would silently assume terminal endpoints and fails the
+`11|2|2` control.
