+```text
+Fig. 10 = 21|21|3,       Fig. 11 = 3|21|21,
+Fig. 13 = 4|211|31,      Fig. 14 = 31|211|4,
+Fig. 15 = 31|31|22,      Fig. 16 = 22|31|31.
+```
+
+These are exactly `DR:383–389,446–473`. The repaired Corollary-5 assembly is
+(`DR:484–529`):
