+| 10 | Exact global Figs. 24/25; their root/nonroot placements; `d_1=1`; target root strictly outside `delta(ab)`; transferred coefficients `18,4,6`; whole-tree determinant identity | `delta(ab)>0`, `y>4`, then (7.3) forces `y=3` | **Not degree-free as a graph kill.** Edge formula, root-unit lemma, and positivity are degree-free; the coefficients and graph determinant are N=4 outputs. |
