+At a cusp the total `Ē_X` load on `l'` is `K` and is all same-branch. At the
+neutral node it is `2W=4`, all exchanged; at `M_{2,1}` it is
+`2(W+1)=6`, of which at most one is same-branch. These are BI-4 budgets, not
