+
+| ID | charged skeleton | charged-point fibres | one-`U_2` cap |
+|---|---|---|---:|
+| `6.3` | `C_3` | `(5,1)` | 1 |
+| `6.4` | `C_1+C_2` | `(3,1,1,1)` and `(4,1,1)` | 0 |
