+
+The growth statement must retain all stages:
+
+```text
+N=5: 86 raw rows; 35 spine-incident first-fork seeds; final survivor count OPEN.
+N=6: 287 raw rows; 85 seeds at W=3 and 126 at W=2; final count OPEN.
+N=7: 717 raw rows; the stated profile rules give 32 charged cells, not 33.
