+```text
+N=7, a=4, W=3: M-types {(2,1)}
+                    x + 3x^2 + 6x^3 + O(x^4),  coefficient = 6;
+N=7, a=5, W=2: M-types {(2,1),(2,2),(2,3),(3,1)}
+                    x + 4x^2 + 11x^3 + 26x^4 + O(x^5), coefficient = 26.
+```
