+| `6.6` | `C_2+M_{2,1}` | `(4,1,1)`; `(3,2,1)` | 4 |
+| `6.7` | `C_1+M_{2,2}` | `(3,1,1,1)`; `(4,2)` **or** `(3,3)` | 5 |
+| `6.8` | `C_1+M_{2,1}+M_{2,1}` | `(3,1,1,1)`; two copies of `(3,2,1)` | 7 |
