+### 3.3 `N=6`, `a=3`: two cells
+
+Here `W=3`, dicritical `(1,3)`, generic meridian `1^3*3`, incident constant
+block Deg `3`, and depth at most `3`.
+
+| ID | charged skeleton | charged-point fibres | neutral `U_2` fibre | one-`U_2` cap on `2p_a` |
