+The ninth `N=6` cell is
+`C_1+C_1+M_{2,1}` (two `K=1` cusps and one charged `r=2`
+multibranch point), with the review's one-neutral-node `2p_a` cap `3`.
+Every affine fibre partition is listed in §3.
