+The determinant variables themselves are not capped by analogy. The bounded
+object is a binary exact audit for each fixed graph in the finite list promised
+by the review. The five frozen inputs provide no valid numerical cardinality
+bound for that whole-graph list: multiplying the per-spine BI-8 cap by a local
+port count would silently turn “on a spine” into “in the tree.”
+
+`OPEN[BI-TAIL-AT-INFINITY]` remains one yes/no for the sole dicritical in each
