+N=6: q=1..6 port counts   810,612,336,195,99,75.
+```
+
+Including diagonal reuse (needed already by N=4 Fig. 25), the equal-degree
+projection contains `sum_q c_q^2 = 86,697` and `1,196,991` ordered pairs.
