+### 5.3 What survives at N=5 and N=6
+
+No lemma in the preceding table fires on an `N=5` or `N=6` seed merely from
+its row. There is no identified analogue graph on which to substitute the
+numeric calculation. Consuming the review's bounded-successor conclusion at
+its confirmed scope (`BR:269–274`), the candidate families are finite but
+their members have not been derived:
