+| `5.1` | `C_2` | cusp `(4,1)` | `(2,2,1)` | 1 |
+| `5.2` | `C_1+C_1` | each cusp `(3,1,1)` | `(2,2,1)` | 0 |
+| `5.3` | `C_1+M_{2,1}` | cusp `(3,1,1)`; charged `r=2` multibranch fibre `(3,2)` | `(2,2,1)` | 4 |
