+
+| ID | charged skeleton | charged-point fibres | neutral `U_2` fibre | one-`U_2` cap on `2p_a` |
+|---|---|---|---|---:|
+| `6.1` | `C_2` | cusp `(5,1)` | `(3,3)` | 3 |
