+Put `W=N-a`. At `N=5,6`, `2 sum s_l<=W` with every `mu_l>=2` forces one
+dicritical with `s=1`; it is `(s,mu)=(1,W)`. Hence `R=sum(s_l-1)=0`.
+For a charged singular point write
