+```text
+mn>W,
+W in {n e : e in lambda_L or lambda_R or lambda_D}.
+```
+
+The N=4 figure convention takes the incident `g`-side to be Proposition 3's
+distinguished `R` direction. The frozen all-N package does not explicitly
