+| window | only `mn>W` | any labelled direction | `R` only, conditional |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| `N=4,W=2` control | 32 | 25 | 13 |
+| `N=5,W=2` | 83 | **67** | **35** |
+| `N=6,W=3` | 278 | **181** | **85** |
+| `N=6,W=2` | 284 | **238** | **126** |
+
+The any-direction breakdowns by `(m,n)` are
