+```text
+R(m,n;i,j,k)=(m,n; P_{m,i}|P_{m,j}|P_{m,k})
+```
+
+to every ordered triple in the table satisfying the length equation, for every
+`1<=n<=floor(N/m)`. This is the complete raw row, with no quotient by direction
+permutations.
