+              (35 in the conditional R subcatalog), P in {5.1,5.2,5.3};
+G_6,3(P)    = extensions of 181 types (conditional R: 85),
+              P in {6.1,6.2};
+G_6,4(P)    = extensions of 238 types (conditional R: 126),
+              P in {6.3,...,6.9}.
+```
