+### 3.5 `N=7`: the stipulated `33` does not reproduce
+
+Here `(B3)` gives `2a>=N` and `a<=N-2`, so only `a=4,5`; `W=3,2` again
+forces the sole dicritical `(s,mu)=(1,W)`.
