+For fixed `(N,a)`, the charged-cell generator implied by the preceding rules is
+
+```text
+[x^(a-1)] (C(x)-1) M(x),
+C(x)=prod_{K=1}^{a-1} (1-x^K)^(-1),
+M(x)=prod_{r>=2,K>=1,N-rW-K>=0} (1-x^K)^(-1).
+```
